      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly i feel like i dont even exist anymore. like i just wake up, go to this job, perform these tasks, and come home to sleep just so i can do it again. i'm not even a person, im just a part of a machine that doesn't even care if i'm here or not. it feels so hollow.",
